/E (Tipping Frontier \(TF\) is a financial consulting company modelling climate, pandemic and conflict risk for institutional investors and public-sector clients. TF uses open-source data and existing methodology to make in-house models demonstrating how these risks may affect infrastructure and economic activity in a given economy. These models are then employed as decision-support tools used to advise clients on investment strategies, intervention and mitigation opportunities, and the development of financial products. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
