223 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 134 0 R
/T (POWERPLANTS Power plant data \(Resource Watch, n.d\) represents where each of the power plants in our geographic area is, as well as crucial information such as their fuel capacity and power generation for different years. This, along with target data, can then be used to predict how much electricity each electrical transmission line holds. Again, a visual aid is provided of the power plants corresponding to the Delhi region. Power plant data are stored in a CSV file containing numerous attributes that characterise each facility, including geometric point data specifying geographic coordinates. Due to the centralised nature of electricity generation and the necessity for distribution across the network, the spatial density of power plant locations is lower than that of target nodes or transmission line infrastructure.)
/E (POWERPLANTS Power plant data \(Resource Watch, n.d\) represents where each of the power plants in our geographic area is, as well as crucial information such as their fuel capacity and power generation for different years. This, along with target data, can then be used to predict how much electricity each electrical transmission line holds. Again, a visual aid is provided of the power plants corresponding to the Delhi region. Power plant data are stored in a CSV file containing numerous attributes that characterise each facility, including geometric point data specifying geographic coordinates. Due to the centralised nature of electricity generation and the necessity for distribution across the network, the spatial density of power plant locations is lower than that of target nodes or transmission line infrastructure.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
