/P 140 0 R
/E (Target nodes represent large geographic areas rather than individual substations or consumers. For example, New Delhi is represented by 70 target nodes despite serving millions of people. Population and GDP are therefore condensed into single points, which reduces spatial realism.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
274 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
