>>
endobj
275 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (Relevance: This aggregation is necessary for computational feasibility. Without it, the model would be intractable at the scale of India. However, it leads to an apparent redundancy of transmission lines, which in reality would distribute load across an area rather than serve a single point.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
276 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
