/P 141 0 R
/E (Relevance: Appropriate for private-sector and financial clients focused on asset protection and returns. For public-sector or humanitarian applications, additional metrics capturing social vulnerability and human impacts would be required. TF professes to be a cascading risk company, therefore the risk of mass climate migration \(cascading from a climate hazard\) may be an additional factor they should account for in this and other models, as this could skew GDP distributions significantly.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [9]
>>
