/P 785 0 R
/E (These dynamics were deliberately abstracted to prioritise transparent hazard-to-impact mapping and consistency across assets and hazard types. Hence, the framework is best suited for screening and comparative risk assessment, rather than detailed operational optimisation or real-time system simulation.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
379 0 obj
<<
